Josh starts off juggling 3 balls. After the end of the fourth week, he will be juggling 7 balls. When he walks on stage, he drops 3 balls, but 2 of them are caught by people in the crowd. Therefore, he will be juggling 7 - 3 + 2 = 6 balls.

The final answer is: \boxed{6}
